{"id":143026501,"slug":"yeah","title":"Yeah!","subtitle":"A lesson in minimalism, from Usher, et. al.","post_date":"2024-04-02T11:39:23.998Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/yeah","wordcount":430,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:53:46.190Z","body_sha256":"807c47ea1a39aa18412898a982f7ffd010d75f9f1b389bc26bb5a4fc99a7a43d","text_words":448,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><strong>The Frontier Psychiatrists</strong> is a health-themed newsletter.  Today, it’s not completely about data or science, it’s about the potency of minimalism.  Sometimes, it is hiding where we least expect it.</p><p>Every once in a while, I try to relax. I'm terrible at relaxing. This is a quality that many individuals attention deficit hyperactivity disorder share.  It is even an element on the <a href=\"https://add.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/adhd-questionnaire-ASRS111.pdf\">ASRS-1</a>, a rating scale for ADHD.  Here are just a few of the items on this particular scale, which I use at work, regularly, because it’s built into my <a href=\"https://www.osmind.org/blog\">EHR, Osmind</a>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic\" width=\"560\" height=\"266.15384615384613\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:692,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:560,&quot;bytes&quot;:98492,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!N12b!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa19cb24e-22fa-40ff-8a6a-8e62484d7afb.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Have you ever felt more seen than <em>question 14</em>?</figcaption></figure></div><p>One of the things I do to relax is cover songs.  I record them.  My most recent cover song?</p><iframe class=\"spotify-wrap album\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b2732ed1a0f26a53b76d6435fa76&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Fast Car&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Owen Muir&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Album&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.spotify.com/album/21RkwfkEZGwB0jVcAVi90i&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;noScroll&quot;:false}\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/album/21RkwfkEZGwB0jVcAVi90i\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" data-component-name=\"Spotify2ToDOM\"></iframe><p>Yes, the Tracy Chapman classic.  This week, for some reason, I decided to work on a cover of Usher’s classic tune, “Yeah!,” which features the perplexingly famous ‘<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lil_Jon\">Lil Jon</a> and the hilarious (and rather gifted) rapper-actor <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ludacris\">Ludacris</a>.  </p><p>Some of the time, when I sit down to figure out a cover song, I realize that the music is quite a bit more complicated than I thought at first. Some of the tunes we bop around to on the regular are breathtakingly complex.  Yesterday, I was checking out “Virtual Insanity” by Jamariqoi.  The first plage of the sheet music looks like this:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic\" width=\"536\" height=\"642.7392550143267\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1674,&quot;width&quot;:1396,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:536,&quot;bytes&quot;:196441,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W6Lr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F26d79468-7535-43f0-9da8-bf26c817dfc1.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Because all of my favorite pop songs have… C#<em>m</em>7<em>b</em>5 chords?  Wait.  No, they do not.  That is some complex harmony!  Coltrane, eat your heart out.</p><p>But, what about those days when you feel like you're not good enough?  The days when you feel like everything is more complicated than it needs to be?  The days when you think you don't have what it takes?  On those days, we have proof that it’s possible to do more with less.  Sometimes, all you need to make the world turn is a collection of credited songwriters:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3apT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29c1c479-81d5-4bb6-92d3-b8a377296968.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3apT!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29c1c479-81d5-4bb6-92d3-b8a377296968.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3apT!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29c1c479-81d5-4bb6-92d3-b8a377296968.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3apT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29c1c479-81d5-4bb6-92d3-b8a377296968.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3apT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29c1c479-81d5-4bb6-92d3-b8a377296968.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3apT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F29c1c479-81d5-4bb6-92d3-b8a377296968.heic\" width=\"1046\" height=\"134\" data-a